# Force LF everywhere, regardless of the checkout OS / core.autocrlf setting.
# The airflow_automation/airflow_demo/ and scenario-player/ scripts (incl. the bin/ fake
# toolchain) are invoked directly via their shebang line on Linux
# (./airflow_automation/airflow_demo/airflow_demo.sh, ./scenario-player/bin/cmsrel, ...); CRLF
# there breaks with "cannot execute: required file not found" because the kernel
# looks for an interpreter literally named e.g. "/bin/bash\r".
* text=auto eol=lf
